step is HA times B. Each bounded block proves its scalar sums and digit parities
with kernel decision, and this module composes the complete 1792-row check.
This discharges precisely the final product premise of
`Conditional.packedRight_eq_rightExpression_of_checks`; expansion of B and the
earlier products belong to their independent certificate modules.
See `../source/README.md` for the exact expression and ATLAS provenance, and
`RightBlocks/source/README.md` for certificate reproduction and measurements.
